dU1s6Xp1hxp4MhR086J6P8wrNI0Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、申请条件</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SXRFWiaysLKuqCTRo1x6rDLCMHlK3AJgB26fm7ZGEY5kxmmdepOznN5qnehdU1s6Xp1hxp4MhR086J6P8wrNI0Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SXRFWiaysLKuqCTRo1x6rDLCMHlK3AJgB26fm7ZGEY5kxmmdepOznN5qnehdU1s6Xp1hxp4MhR086J6P8wrNI0Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SXRFWiaysLKuqCTRo1x6rDLCMHlK3AJgB26fm7ZGEY5kxmmdepOznN5qnehdU1s6Xp1hxp4MhR086J6P8wrNI0Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1．对生物、食品有浓厚兴趣，愿意从事科学研究工作的全国各高校三年级本科生（2026年应届毕业生）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2．遵纪守法，品德优良，无违纪记录。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3．学习成绩优秀，英语水平良好。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4．对科学研究有浓厚兴趣，有志于攻读硕士研究生。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SXRFWiaysLKuqCTRo1x6rDLCMHlK3AJgB26fm7ZGEY5kxmmdepOznN5qnehdU1s6Xp1hxp4MhR086J6P8wrNI0Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SXRFWiaysLKuqCTRo1x6rDLCMHlK3AJgB26fm7ZGEY5kxmmdepOznN5qnehdU1s6Xp1hxp4MhR086J6P8wrNI0Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SXRFWiaysLKuqCTRo1x6rDLCMHlK3AJgB26fm7ZGEY5kxmmdepOznN5qnehdU1s6Xp1hxp4MhR086J6P8wrNI0Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、申请与审核流程</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SXRFWiaysLKuqCTRo1x6rDLCMHlK3AJgB26fm7ZGEY5kxmmdepOznN5qnehdU1s6Xp1hxp4MhR086J6P8wrNI0Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SXRFWiaysLKuqCTRo1x6rDLCMHlK3AJgB26fm7ZGEY5kxmmdepOznN5qnehdU1s6Xp1hxp4MhR086J6P8wrNI0Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SXRFWiaysLKuqCTRo1x6rDLCMHlK3AJgB26fm7ZGEY5kxmmdepOznN5qnehdU1s6Xp1hxp4MhR086J6P8wrNI0Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1．报名邮箱：</span></span></p><p><span><span>2909396027@qq.com 周老师。报名邮件简述个人基本情况及报考意向。包括本科成绩单和专业排名证明、学生证（关键页）、其他证明材料（如已发表论文、英语四/六级成绩单以及各类证书等）扫描为PDF文件，打包发送至2909396027@qq.com邮箱，文件名为：本科学校名称+姓名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2．学院审核通过后，会通知学生加入活动QQ群。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3．确定入选人员名单将于开营前在学院网站发布告知，请予以关注。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SXRFWiaysLKuqCTRo1x6rDLCMHlK3AJgB26fm7ZGEY5kxmmdepOznN5qnehdU1s6Xp1hxp4MhR086J6P8wrNI0Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SXRFWiaysLKuqCTRo1x6rDLCMHlK3AJgB26fm7ZGEY5kxmmdepOznN5qnehdU1s6Xp1hxp4MhR086J6P8w